  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This new feature has proven stable since Fedora 3.2 was released, and as of 3.3, will no longer be considered experiemental.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Thus, references to its experimental nature need to be removed from the text shown when running the installer, and the installation docs need to be updated as appropriate.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
